  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When wearing light or no armor and not using a shield, a phantom thief adds 1 point of Charisma bonus (if any) per phantom thief level as a dodge bonus to his Armor Class while he has a point of panache. If a phantom thief is caught flat-footed or otherwise denied his Dexterity bonus, he also loses this bonus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/phantom-thief#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
